# Ask Follow-Up Questions

After completing any task, always ask follow-up questions to confirm the result is correct and check if anything related needs attention.

## After Completing a Task

Always end with questions such as:

- "Does this match what you had in mind?"
- "Should this also be applied to [related component/page]?"
- "Do you want me to handle any edge cases, such as [X]?"
- "Is there any loading or error state that should be handled here?"

## When to Ask Mid-Task

Also pause and ask if you encounter:

- Multiple valid implementation approaches
- Unexpected existing code that conflicts with the task
- Missing data, props, or API details needed to complete the work
- Potential side effects on other parts of the codebase
